# Architecture (short)

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| App | Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + Tailwind 4 |
| Data | Supabase (Postgres): `projects`, `certificates`, `companies`, `allowed_users` |
| Auth | Supabase OAuth + email; whitelist `ADMIN_ALLOWED_EMAILS` |
| Edge | `proxy.ts` (session refresh + `/admin` guard) |
| Host | Vercel / v0 deploy from `main` |

## Routes

- Public: `app/(public)/` — home, about, projects
- Admin CRUD: `app/admin/*` + `app/api/admin/*`
- Public API: `app/api/public/*` (prefer server fetch for pages; keep API for clients that need it)
- Auth: `app/api/auth/*`, `app/login`

## Agent entry points

- Docs index: `docs/README.md`
- Perf plan: `docs/performance.md`
